        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HISTORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when King Arthur's heroes thought they'd earned a break, their dreamy vacation turns into a cursed adventure when the Gremlin pulls a mysterious chest from the sea! Inside it: treasure, riches, and... a pirate hat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988390/extras/72a7d66e05060b970ba30314c99b3021.avif?t=1758096333\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before long, the owner of the hat reveals himself to be Captain Ghost, a fabled phantom pirate. Bitter from the perceived looting, the Captain casts our heroes to an uninhabited island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, trapped in unfamiliar territory, their only chance of escape is to win the ultimate pirate regatta. Unfortunately, they're not the only ones hoping to attain freedom. The brothers Zu, Vu, and Glu are also hunting for their way out, but only the winner gets the prize!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's down to you to help our heroes be the first to recover the four pieces of a map that will lead them to liberation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988390/extras/d4a0e8a08108a10d8a3042ffc48ffefd.avif?t=1758096333\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In New Yankee: Pirate Trap, as in any time manager, you have to accurately calculate the time for building, collecting resources, and timely use of bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a large variety of buildings and unique items. By collecting them, you will complete tasks and embark on unique adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with Sir John and Lady Mary, perform a variety of tasks in a wonderful fantasy world, fight dragons, vampires, and other fairy tale creatures. You must help our heroes be the first to find the four parts of the map that will lead them to freedom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988390/extras/acfd052dc9eddb4489e61162b3e2a0db.avif?t=1758096333\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete 60 levels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 levels with mini-games </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy downloadable Original Soundtrack </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful desktop wallpapers </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separate access to clips, character descriptions and a guide </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn dozens of achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different equipment for your heroes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels strategy guide </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible puzzle pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988390/extras/a7298f3405f6c932789c0929d72f8f5c.avif?t=1758096333\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HISTORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when King Arthur's heroes thought they'd earned a break, their dreamy vacation turns into a cursed adventure when the Gremlin pulls a mysterious chest from the sea! Inside it: treasure, riches, and... a pirate hat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988390/extras/72a7d66e05060b970ba30314c99b3021.avif?t=1758096333\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before long, the owner of the hat reveals himself to be Captain Ghost, a fabled phantom pirate. Bitter from the perceived looting, the Captain casts our heroes to an uninhabited island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, trapped in unfamiliar territory, their only chance of escape is to win the ultimate pirate regatta. Unfortunately, they're not the only ones hoping to attain freedom. The brothers Zu, Vu, and Glu are also hunting for their way out, but only the winner gets the prize!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's down to you to help our heroes be the first to recover the four pieces of a map that will lead them to liberation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988390/extras/d4a0e8a08108a10d8a3042ffc48ffefd.avif?t=1758096333\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In New Yankee: Pirate Trap, as in any time manager, you have to accurately calculate the time for building, collecting resources, and timely use of bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a large variety of buildings and unique items. By collecting them, you will complete tasks and embark on unique adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with Sir John and Lady Mary, perform a variety of tasks in a wonderful fantasy world, fight dragons, vampires, and other fairy tale creatures. You must help our heroes be the first to find the four parts of the map that will lead them to freedom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988390/extras/acfd052dc9eddb4489e61162b3e2a0db.avif?t=1758096333\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete 60 levels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 levels with mini-games </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy downloadable Original Soundtrack </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful desktop wallpapers </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separate access to clips, character descriptions and a guide </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn dozens of achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different equipment for your heroes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels strategy guide </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible puzzle pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988390/extras/a7298f3405f6c932789c0929d72f8f5c.avif?t=1758096333\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Just when King Arthur's heroes thought they'd earned a break, the Gremlin pulled a mysterious chest from the sea. Captain Ghost, the chest’s owner, casts Camelot’s heroes to an uninhabited island, where they must compete for their freedom!",
